*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "MINIXPRT.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Seznik"
*Product: "(MiniX)"
*ModelName: "MiniX thermal printer"
*ShortNickName: "MiniX"
*NickName: "Seznik MiniX 48mm thermal (minixprint)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.2
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-pdf application/pdf 0 -"

*% 384 dots at 203 dpi = 48 mm = 136 pt. Roll: the length is free (apps may use Custom).
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Roll48x200
*PageSize Roll48x100/48 mm x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[136 283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Roll48x200/48 mm x 200 mm: "<</PageSize[136 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Roll48x400/48 mm x 400 mm: "<</PageSize[136 1134]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Roll48x200
*PageRegion Roll48x100/48 mm x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[136 283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Roll48x200/48 mm x 200 mm: "<</PageSize[136 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Roll48x400/48 mm x 400 mm: "<</PageSize[136 1134]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Roll48x200
*ImageableArea Roll48x100/48 mm x 100 mm: "0 0 136 283"
*ImageableArea Roll48x200/48 mm x 200 mm: "0 0 136 567"
*ImageableArea Roll48x400/48 mm x 400 mm: "0 0 136 1134"
*DefaultPaperDimension: Roll48x200
*PaperDimension Roll48x100/48 mm x 100 mm: "136 283"
*PaperDimension Roll48x200/48 mm x 200 mm: "136 567"
*PaperDimension Roll48x400/48 mm x 400 mm: "136 1134"

*% Any length from 20 mm to 2 m, width fixed at 48 mm; no margins.
*MaxMediaWidth: "136"
*MaxMediaHeight: "5669"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 136 136
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 57 5669
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 18/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
